At Jahn Elementary of the Fine Arts, we strive to meet the needs of all students academically, socially, and emotionally through a welcoming and equitable environment.&nbsp; Our instruction and staff will honor problem solving, creativity and engagement and promote high order thinking and arts integration. We endeavor to build a safe space for all students to express their individuality and take risks in order to grow into lifelong learners. Through nurturing relationships we share a collective responsibility for the growth of our community.
